# Files first

- Track backlog in `Docs/WORK.yaml`, target authority under `Docs/Evidence/<target>/`, and short
  session status in `Docs/NOW.md`. Product truth is `Docs/PRODUCT.md` and specs.
- Use `Docs/Development/` templates and run `npm run docs:check` after metadata changes.
- Implement in `apps/web/`, `packages/`, and `content/`. Prove with tests or the app.
- Follow `Docs/CLOSE.md` for candidate-pinned checks and independent audit sub-agents.
- Stay in this session. For a phase, coordinate and delegate coding by area to in-session
  sub-agents; do not start another agent runner.
